WHAT THIS DOES

1. Finds the claim returned by the trading partner using F8.
2. Gets in-process and review workflow type IDs from repricing_configuration.
3. Converts those workflow type IDs into actual claim_workflow_id values using claim_workflow.
4. Only moves the claim if it is currently in the configured in-process workflow.
5. Updates claim.claim_workflow_id to the configured review workflow.
6. Inserts a claim_comment.
7. Preserves the existing x12_837_2300 error/processed behavior.
8. Continues to NEXT_CLAIM.

